date-released: "2026-09-15"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - clinical-trials
  - health-ai
  - market-research
  - ClinicalTrials.gov
abstract: >-
  A reproducible market analysis of 4,250 ClinicalTrials.gov studies whose
  intervention descriptions reference artificial intelligence or machine
  learning (snapshot 2026-09-15). Includes the raw registry extract (JSONL),
  a flattened CSV, computed statistics, a deterministic zero-dependency Python
  pipeline, and four publication-grade figures.
